WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:132000

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
As an independent freelancer in India,

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:07.300
figuring out which tax rules apply to me
can feel overwhelming.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.650
If I Google
"Indian freelancer tax filing",

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.850
there's plenty of information.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.900
But which parts apply to me,

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.850
and what do I actually do next?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.200
That's why I built My Next Filing.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.250
Let me show you an example.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.950
I answer questions about my work,

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.200
enter my income and taxes already paid,

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.950
review my answers,
and calculate my plan.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.950
Ah, here's my next action.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:43.050
The date and the estimated amount
left to pay.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.580
Below it, the remaining dates
are in order.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.950
I can check the calculation

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:52.350
and open the official guidance
for each action.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.480
I can also save my data in this browser

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.080
and record what I've completed.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.880
I still file and pay outside the website.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.000
This helps me prepare.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.760
My last submission was a proof of concept,

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.050
built in 24 hours.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.950
This round, I built a plan
freelancers can return to.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.800
It now supports more work types,

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.900
including eligible work
through platforms like Upwork

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.150
and overseas clients.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.300
But the biggest change?

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.650
What happens when I come back?

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.700
I reopen my saved plan,

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:36.400
update the amount paid, and recalculate.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.850
The balance is now zero.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.950
I mark that action completed,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.850
and the next action changes.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.100
That's what matters.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.900
The plan reflects my progress.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.300
My answers stay in this browser.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.450
The calculations happen here too.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:59.100
Clearer questions and help
explain what to enter.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:03.050
Unsupported answers get
an immediate explanation,

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.500
so I know when this tool can't help.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.350
Each action links to the
relevant government page.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.350
The question stays the same:

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.700
What should I file next?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.400
Now I can keep coming back to the answer.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.400
And that's it.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:22.500
Thanks.
